.TH ANOMALY 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
anomaly \- Run the Anomaly Detection service and bridge MBC cartridge scores into it (ADR\-108).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B anomaly
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the Anomaly Detection service and bridge MBC cartridge scores into it (ADR\-108).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-listen \fISTRING\fR
HTTP listen address (loopback by default; off loopback needs AUTH_ENABLED=true) (default 127.0.0.1:19018)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-cartridge
run the service without the cartridge bridge
.TP
.B \-\-pin\-dir \fISTRING\fR
bpffs directory of the pinned cartridge interpreter (default /sys/fs/bpf/unheaded/cart)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan \fISTRING\fR
Wotan HTTP address: publish anomaly.scores there (default: in\-process intake)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
anomaly
anomaly \-\-pin\-dir /sys/fs/bpf/unheaded
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
